-- Around the machine-word boundary: fib 92 is the last one that
-- fits a 64-bit Int, fib 93 is the first that does not. AHC's
-- Integer is a hand-rolled bignum, GHC's is GMP, and they must
-- agree digit for digit.
90 91 92 93 94
